# GTKTerm Automation Script
# Test embedded system bootloader

# Reset device with DTR
log Resetting device...
set_dtr 0
delay 100
set_dtr 1
delay 500

# Wait for bootloader prompt
expect Bootloader v
delay 100

# Send erase command
log Erasing flash...
send erase\r\n
expect Erase complete
delay 1000

# Load firmware
log Loading firmware...
send load\r\n
expect Ready for data

# In real use, you would trigger XMODEM transfer here
# This is just a demonstration

delay 100
send \x03
delay 100

# Verify
log Verifying firmware...
send verify\r\n
expect CRC: OK
delay 500

# Boot
log Booting application...
send boot\r\n
expect Application started

log Firmware update completed!
